        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi gabiikta gicha ghoaghu eaweega Sawli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghwahidu fuga Sifiti heeda Sawli aba Gibeya, ak gwayi, “Neada Dawdi ea mwafunya geaw aba uhuuda heayeeda Hakila mida gayeewda Yeshimonihi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Sawli ak ghwararang'aada ak gawa dareapcheeda Sifu, sea fih sagalamnyooji samwagu siloat bea Israeli, gagasa Dawdi aba dareapcheeda Sifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin Sawli museasooda aba uhuuda heayeeda Hakila, mida murdeeda naweeda mida gayeewda Yeshimoni. Ak goobiida Dawdi dareapcheeda; amadu nea ghwadaah gideaba gweadu geeshtaanyi Sawli aba dareapcheeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goojeakta Dawdi fuga weay ghaghwalda gheang'da, ak gwasikteawa aba huumwa gideaba nihidu Sawli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat Dawdi ak ghwahidu heeda sissa Sawli museasooda; ak ghwadaah Dawdi heeda lila Sawli, sea Abna orjeeda Neri, was shirikarajeanda haw bea lugoadaanyi; abeeda Sawli gawiil geaw aba jeeda museasooda, nea abeeda gwaneaweesa niny lugooda aba jeeda museasooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Dawdi Ahimeleki was siida eemeeda Hiti, ea heeda orjeeda geenyea Yoabu siguura Abishayi orjeeda Seruya, “Gaydeadeayi ng'eaha eararang'aada eeweaya jeeda museasooda heeda Sawli?” Ghwalamda Abishayi ak gwayeesha, “Gajeeteayeena sea ang'iing'i.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Dawdi sea Abishayi jeeda lugooda eawa; ak ghwahita nea gwalil Sawli aba bugusta museasooda nea ning'uda ng'utaanyi ng'eanyi aba deascheeda uhuudaanyi; nea Abna sea lugooda gwalil aba murdeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Abishayi Dawdi, “Niyiin ASEETA weajoodigaagu geatingaagu askweareani; asi ghamneawa nung' dang'usa ng'eanyi aba ng'utaanyi aba hisiinagi, ak ea maydabiikta dang'ut deaba iyeenya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha Abishayi, “Adiidu gibwari niny; aba gideaba gajea ng'eaha siida jea gooheaksa geadi siida amwaar NG'UTAMIIDA ak ea mwanyasa giidiinyeanda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Dawdi, “Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA, gayghwalas NG'UTAMIIDA niny; ghana goosha eaweagaaschi ak ghami; ghana gawa ng'ucheeda ak ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaheawa NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba gaydeaheaksa geatindeanyu siida amwaar NG'UTAMIIDA; asi geanda ng'uta mida deascheeda uhuudaanyi, ea sirbiida beega ak ginung' eeweaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu Dawdi ng'uta ea sirbiida beega aba deascheeda uhuuda Sawli; ak gaweay. Ak ea manda siida nidaah, ghana ghwanal ghana dea ng'eat; aba gideaba gwalil sean, aba gideaba goobissa saawa ruweanga ng'weani leabu heeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa Dawdi googeawsa meatkweeda niirja, ak ghamiinaada nea sheagi aba uhuuda giijeeda, nea haw dageascheeda nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gaguursa Dawdi lugooda, sea Abna orjeeda Neri, ak gwayeesha, “Mwayshaaha gili, Abna?” Ghwalamda Abna ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i ng'eaha iguuriisi NG'UTAMIIDEAN?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha Abna, “Ang'iing'i neada ea muwoosi ng'eedeeda? Gawuurjeeweey ng'eaha aba ng'eanyiida Israeli? Abeeda ghwasaan inyas mifuri ng'utamiidaang'u was sugoocheanda? Aba gideaba nihidu sih nea gagasa ghabwar sugoocheanda was ng'utamiidaang'u ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanji isiniin mii miy. Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA, gahaguuw gideaba gaymeawa, aba gideaba mifuri ng'utamiidaang'u, was dea amwaar NG'UTAMIIDA. Asi ghamneawa daaha heeda mida ng'uta sugoocheanda, ea sirbiida beega mida deascheeda uhuudaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanal Sawli ghuuta Dawdi, ak gwayeesha, “Nih ghuutaang'u orjeedeanyu Dawdi?” Ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Nih ghuuteanyu gil, ng'utamiideanyu, Ea sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan inyas sugoocheandeanyu gamaseaw siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda? Neada ea neasinyi naaha? Geatingeasu gwanda munyimba naaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa gagasa ghwayiiy ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda ng'asheega siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda. Ii ng'utamiida gil dea nung' nyareeksean, gidabal ghamwas haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda; amadeepa ea buuneeda gil, ea deamwaashta aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; aba gideaba nihoanan askweareani ak ea mwaanyasi hearaniischooda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gwayi, ‘Una bwada aseecheeka suuk.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, adiidu gaweayeesa foojeandeanyu badayda ng'eanyiida ak geasheagiidi madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; aba gideaba sugoocheanda Israeli nuwu gagasa eaweegeasu, gawuurji siida ak shageata udamughuushta aba iheenga giijeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Sawli ak gwayi, “Neasinyi ng'asheega munyas; biikni, orjeedeanyu Dawdi, aba gideaba maygudu dasimaneey gidamuy, aba gideaba eaweegeasu ghang'alda aba madeeda gheanyangaagu askweareani; ng'ula, aniini neasinyi leendeeda, neasinyi ng'asheanda muy muuchi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha Dawdi nea gwayeesha, “Nukwa ng'utaang'u, Ea sugoocheanda! Nung' ghwaan gheareemaneanagi ghamwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoamwaar NG'UTAMIIDA gili was sih aba doobiiwnataanyi ea ng'eenindaanyi; aba gideaba ghwayiinyi NG'UTAMIIDA geatingeasu askweareani, ak ea maydeaheaksa geatindeanyu siida amwaar NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, eaweagaagu ghang'alda askweareani aba madeedeanyu, ak gidabal ghang'alda eaweegeasu aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gooheeleewanean ng'asheega sean munyas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Sawli ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Gagasa nyasa ghawooda, orjeedeanyu Dawdi! Gaysina haleanjeeda saang'a ak gaynyagaada aba haleanjeeda sean.” Hean gawa Dawdi bareanyeakaaschi, nea gabiikta Sawli ghoah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
